+/**
+ * @file
+ * Interface Identification APIs from:
+ *              RFC 3493: Basic Socket Interface Extensions for IPv6
+ *                  Section 4: Interface Identification
+ *
+ * @defgroup if_api Interface Identification API
+ * @ingroup socket
+ */
